  * Rebuilt against upstream v0.19.0 (tagged at 7b278451; main two commits further at f020bd3a).
    This is the first packaging of that release, so the upstream version in the version string moves
    for the first time since 0.18.0-1 rather than the revision: version.txt is 0.19.0 and the top
    entry is authored to match, the same alignment check in debian/rules that refuses a build whose
