gufo (0.17.1-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * prerm wording: it said "no running gufo unit found, nothing to restart after this upgrade".
    With an instance configured, enabled and stopped by the operator that sentence was a claim
    about the whole transaction made by the half of it that enumerates nothing - and the postinst,
    one step later, reported units found and deliberately left down. It now states only what
    prerm itself did: nothing was active, so nothing was stopped.

